{"src":"ru","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":213700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ru","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10537.326051,"text":"В 1990 году он был добавлен в список всемирного наследия, находящегося под угрозой из-за опасности со стороны песков в пустыне."},{"kind":"text","t":10983.253323,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the List of World Heritage in Danger due to the threat from desert sands."},{"kind":"audio","t":11051.558609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11056.41823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11061.822263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11067.005269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11072.265494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11075.691135,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":24551.038516,"text":"Если вы смотрели фильм «Сокровища нации», то можете подумать, что на оборотной стороне Декларации независимости была изображена карта сокровищ."},{"kind":"text","t":25081.819647999997,"text":"If you've seen the movie \"National Treasure,\" you might think that there was a treasure map depicted on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":25152.866786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25157.774766000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25163.272267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25168.721380000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25173.874236000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25179.181109999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25182.785108999997,"samples":25392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":36334.755667,"text":"Тети передаются под опеку по множеству разнообразных причин. От беспризорности до жестокого обращения и даже вымогательств."},{"kind":"text","t":36619.096203,"text":"Aunts are placed under guardianship for a wide variety of reasons. From neglect to abuse and even extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":36671.931188999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36673.395138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36674.943056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36675.38121,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"audio","t":36746.090632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36747.486842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36747.742148,"samples":16064,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":45731.349852,"text":"Долина Качама – главное направление в Чире для альпинизма. Она известна как Йосмит Южной Америки и имеет большое количество..."},{"kind":"text","t":46054.584223,"text":"Kachama Valley is the main destination for mountaineering in Chire. It is known as the Yosemite of South America and has a large number of..."},{"kind":"audio","t":46108.379285999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":46110.082422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46111.721319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46112.716284999995,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"audio","t":46174.318926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46175.803145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46177.316284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46178.94968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":46179.283526,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":48901.292305999996,"text":"больших гранитных стен и скал."},{"kind":"text","t":49054.675049,"text":"large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":49103.159948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49104.291132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":49104.615027,"samples":1064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":57770.330123,"text":"Во всех научных вопросах, включая психологию, были приняты взгляды Аристотеля."},{"kind":"text","t":58060.359158,"text":"Aristotle's views were adopted in all scientific matters, including psychology."},{"kind":"audio","t":58114.872920999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58116.250281,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58117.727159999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":58119.618263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":58120.040767,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68154.598407,"text":"Если вы не привыкли ездить по сельским дорогам, будьте начеку. Преобладают крутые склоны, узкие переулки и резкие повороты."},{"kind":"text","t":68431.449129,"text":"If you are not used to driving on country roads, stay alert. Steep slopes, narrow alleys, and sharp turns predominate."},{"kind":"audio","t":68486.755901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68492.019636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68497.26543099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":68497.93608099999,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":68555.800666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68561.08373099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68566.461254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":68566.600892,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77298.978538,"text":"Наличие настоящей невидимой команды. Ларсон и Лафаста, 1989 год, страница 109."},{"kind":"text","t":77650.75657299999,"text":"The presence of a real invisible team. Larson and Lafasta, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":77718.382128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77724.58097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":77726.523082,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"audio","t":77773.958936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77779.96094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77785.53348099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77789.507184,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":81721.239397,"text":"также является уникальным компонентом виртуальной команды."},{"kind":"text","t":81933.78079599999,"text":"is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":81987.135965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81992.479509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81996.544111,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":87175.495031,"text":"После несчастного случая Гибсон был доставлен в больницу, но вскоре скончался."},{"kind":"text","t":87480.401704,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to the hospital, but died shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":87536.76559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87541.844638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87547.082513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87552.247819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":87553.255245,"samples":11728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97876.39991,"text":"В немецкой выпечке часто используются миндаль, фундук и другие древесные орехи. Зачастую популярные торты отлично сочетаются с чашкой крепкого кофе."},{"kind":"text","t":98187.96786799999,"text":"Almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts are often used in German pastries. Popular cakes often pair perfectly with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":98251.001239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98256.100416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98261.197103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98266.68689499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98267.689221,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":98316.71567199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":98322.008376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98327.34462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98330.260629,"samples":21696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":104690.432557,"text":"Очевидно, что если владеешь языком романской подгруппы, тебе будет проще выучить португальский."},{"kind":"text","t":105053.206685,"text":"Obviously, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":105096.329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105098.282972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105100.052537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105101.96856,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105102.69319,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":113921.411074,"text":"Звуковое и световое шоу на фоне пирамиды является одним из самых интересных мероприятий в этой местности для детей."},{"kind":"text","t":114354.884684,"text":"The sound and light show against the backdrop of the pyramid is one of the most interesting activities for children in this area."},{"kind":"audio","t":114415.345622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114417.289034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114419.183117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":114421.02536099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114423.070192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114425.011094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":114425.181912,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":123656.68698099999,"text":"Изучение движения отдельных водителей и автомобилей между двумя точками и их взаимодействия друг с другом осуществляется в рамках исследования транспортных потоков."},{"kind":"text","t":124173.767808,"text":"The study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and their interaction with one another is carried out as part of traffic flow research."},{"kind":"audio","t":124247.356289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124252.83343099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124258.170275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124263.285902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":124268.673795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124274.012589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124279.57849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124283.120789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":124283.492054,"samples":6656,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131927.764324,"text":"Астролиз Митчелл Гурли пришел к финишу 11 в соревнованиях по супергиганту для мужчин в классе стоя."},{"kind":"text","t":132338.35572,"text":"Astroliz Mitchell Gurley finished 11th in the men's super-G standing class."},{"kind":"audio","t":132395.30389799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132400.433205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132405.708359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132411.389798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":132411.705694,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":139119.625694,"text":"Чех Олдрич Еленек пришел к финишу 16 в соревнованиях по супергиганту для мужчин в классе сидя."},{"kind":"text","t":139498.809227,"text":"Czech Aldrich Jelének finished 16th in the men's super-G sitting class."},{"kind":"audio","t":139553.574176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139558.78245199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139563.86481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139567.35100999998,"samples":25296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":152049.261697,"text":"Гаитянский институт справедливости и демократии сослался на независимое исследование, которое предполагает, что в России есть несколько стран, которые не имеют права на право на действие."},{"kind":"text","t":152603.85787,"text":"The Haitian Institute of Justice and Democracy cited an independent study suggesting that there are several countries in Russia that do not have a right to the right of action."},{"kind":"audio","t":152668.699115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152674.046549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152679.240555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152684.557129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152689.932752,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152696.320651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152701.34307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152704.630593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152707.747679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"audio","t":152708.021855,"samples":888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152900.128536,"text":"что непальский миротворческий батальон ООН непреднамеренно завез заболевание в Гаити."},{"kind":"text","t":153183.848781,"text":"that a Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unintentionally brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":153237.039262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153238.776098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153240.573082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153242.548464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153243.78868599999,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":159355.156191,"text":"Вскоре после начала военных действий Британия устроила морскую блокаду Германии."},{"kind":"text","t":159649.294328,"text":"Shortly after the start of hostilities, Britain established a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159708.895008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159714.189282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":159719.868391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159724.743512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159728.242502,"samples":24328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":168731.270449,"text":"Он также атаковал все, что входило в воду. Даже гигантский динозавр, такой как тираннозавр, не сравнился бы с ним."},{"kind":"text","t":169088.16597,"text":"He also attacked everything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur, such as a Tyrannosaurus, would not compare to it."},{"kind":"audio","t":169150.381073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":169154.08453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169157.060488,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"audio","t":169226.929202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169230.501851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169236.026992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169240.474949,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":178177.221291,"text":"Использование видеозаписи привело к важным открытиям в сфере интерпретации микровыражений."},{"kind":"text","t":178503.530508,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important discoveries in the field of microexpression interpretation."},{"kind":"audio","t":178566.626258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178572.16649899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178577.662161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178583.069274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178588.524086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178592.183364,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":182414.987529,"text":"Движение лица длительностью несколько миллисекунд."},{"kind":"text","t":182596.684389,"text":"Facial movements lasting a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":182649.421027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":182654.745171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":182658.34285,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":192716.280016,"text":"Заявление было сделано после того, как Трамп провел телефонный разговор с президентом Турции Реджипом Таипом Эрдоганом."},{"kind":"text","t":193038.380273,"text":"The statement was made after Trump held a phone call with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdoğan."},{"kind":"audio","t":193093.748854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193095.397321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193096.81672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193098.428387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193100.440989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":193100.781874,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":202305.284548,"text":"Это иногда переполнено народом семейные пляжи с хорошим выбором магазинов, расположенных вдоль берега. Плавать безопасно."},{"kind":"text","t":202709.366926,"text":"These family beaches are sometimes crowded and have a good selection of shops located along the shore. Swimming is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":202769.796115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202774.864633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202779.96471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202785.393362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202790.968483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":202791.273239,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":202841.84335799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202842.648656,"samples":12832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":212532.245394,"text":"Почти все более мелкие острова являются независимыми государствами или ассоциированы с Францией и известны как шикарные пляжные курорты."},{"kind":"text","t":212926.788839,"text":"Almost all of the smaller islands are independent states or associated with France and are known as glamorous beach resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212987.649731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212993.028844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212998.000223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":213003.287578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213008.841729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213014.239142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213017.33295799998,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"close","t":223702.252995,"code":1005}]}